# App craft swarm (Mcfly)

When polishing the embedded app for listing / world-class desk UX, spawn **parallel Task specialists with explicit models** — never one Auto-everything pass.

## Required roster (one owner per lane)

| Agent | Model slug | Owns (only) |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Cash MER craft | `claude-fable-5-thinking-high` (or Opus) | `app._index.tsx`, Cash MER classes in `mcfly-desk.css` |
| Spend CSV UX | `claude-sonnet-5-thinking-high` | `app.spend.tsx`, `spend-csv.ts`, `.mcfly-spend-*` CSS only |
| Allocation / Settings / Demo | `claude-sonnet-5-thinking-high` | `app.allocation.tsx`, `app.settings.tsx`, `app.demo.tsx`, `.mcfly-alloc-*` / `.mcfly-settings-*` / `.mcfly-demo-*` |
| Reject-risk critic | `cursor-grok-4.5-high-fast` | Docs audit only (`REJECT_RISK_AUDIT.md`, `SUBMIT_TOMORROW.md`) |

Parent (Auto): integrate, resolve CSS collisions, `bash scripts/agent-ship-gate.sh`, Fly deploy, human-gate list.

## Hard rules

1. Set Task `model` explicitly — never inherit for craft lanes.
2. One file owner — no three agents rewriting `app._index.tsx`.
3. Listing shots: Demo seed → ON → `/app?period=y3&shot=1` (hides SAMPLE banner).
4. Before reviewer smoke: sample desk **OFF**.
5. Religion: cash MER = sales ÷ spend; refuse pixels/MTA/TW clones; Free listing until Billing.
6. Site mega-ticks stay IDLE until Pages deploy (`SITE_CRAFT_NEXT.md`) — this rule is **app lane**.
7. **Apps Script parity:** Cash MER Fable/Opus agent must read `docs/APPS_SCRIPT_CRAFT_SPEC.md` + `vendor/mer-apps-script/Stylesheet.html` and return the parity scorecard (mean ≥ 4.0 or list gaps). See rule `65-apps-script-mer-craft.mdc`.

